<title>SINGAPORE: ADNOC tenders to sell jet fuel for Sept 25-27.</title>
<headline>ADNOC tenders to sell jet fuel for Sept 25-27.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) has issued a tender to sell 50,000 tonnes of jet fuel for September 25-27 lifting, on a free-on-board (fob) basis from Ruwais, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on August 25 and bids will be valid until August 27.</p>
